        },
        {
          "text": "Era yaaba dhaadha w'ebika ebyali mu Kiriathi Yearimu, bino: Abaithiri, Abaputhi, Abashumathi, n'Abamishirai. Mu bika ebyo n'omwava Abazorathi n'Abeshitaoli.",
